P5.  THE CEILING IS SET BY THE LEVEL OF THE ELASTICITY, NOT ITS SPREAD
========================================================================================================
 elasticity_mean  true_mean  mean_eps     vus  chance  ceiling  vus_norm   verdict
         +0.0000    +0.4204   +0.2111 +0.1749 +0.1667  +0.1913   +0.3355 plausible
